                </div>
                <h3>Grounded</h3>
                <p>Every session begins with presence &mdash; no rushing, just space to arrive.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3v2.4M12 18.6V21M21 12h-2.4M5.4 12H3M12 8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Intuitive</h3>
                <p>I follow what your energy needs in the moment, not a fixed script.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-9.5-9C.6 7.4 2.5 4 6 4c2 0 3.5 1.1 4.5 2.6C11.5 5.1 13 4 15 4c3.5 0 5.4 3.4 3.5 7-2.5 4.6-9.5 9-9.5 9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Heart-Centered</h3>
                <p>You're met with compassion, never judgment, exactly as you are.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit">
                <div class="benefit-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /><path d="M9 12h6M12 9v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Safe &amp; Supportive</h3>
                <p>A confidential space held just for you and your healing process.</p>
            </div>
